  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.<br>• Transfer corn to a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave corn on high, until tender, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Drain any excess liquid. Season with salt and pepper. Top corn with the butter and cover to keep warm.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83f9f6ec352636ca19129/step-f6542500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry. Slice haloumi horizontally to get one thin piece per person.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side.<br>• Remove pan from heat and add harissa paste, the honey and water, turning haloumi to coat.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83f9f6ec352636ca19129/step-ff924810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Halve bake-at-home burger buns and toast or grill to your liking.<br>• Thinly slice tomato into rounds.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83f9f6ec352636ca19129/step-d21f5620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Spread dill &amp; parsley mayonnaise over bun bases then top with mixed salad leaves, honey-harissa haloumi, sliced tomato and gherkin relish. Spoon over any remaining harissa glaze. Serve with buttered corn cobs. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83f9f6ec352636ca19129/step-78a0ed30.jpg"
    }
  ]
